e and the approximate double bottom with 2357.18, weakening the Always-In Long read and supporting a larger trading range 2357.18-2850.", "Range development: five or more further bars overlapping inside 2633.31-2786.81 without a new high would turn the pause into a trading range at the highs and lower Always-In relevance."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790409599999, "directional_pressure": "balanced", "evidence_against": ["The 2850 high (1789977600000) is a buy-climax bar: 191.94-point range, 126.85-point upper tail, close in the lower third. That is a stalled breakout, not acceptance at the highs.", "Highs since the climax step down: 2850, 2804.59 (1790020800000), 2786.81 (1790136000000), 2740.42 (1790323200000); the 2740.42 probe closed back at 2715.90 and was not held, an mtr-like lower-high shape.", "The window's first 30 bars are a two-sided 2411.04-2528.8 range and its upward spike to 2680 failed, so the 20-day chart is not a clean one-way trend; the current close 2689.76 also sits in the lower half of the 2633.31-2804.59 range.", "The final four bars have 7.68 to 18.16-point ranges with no follow-through in either direction, so bar-by-bar pressure is currently two-sided rather than trending."], "evidence_for": ["Higher-low sequence intact: window low 2358.62 was followed by higher swing lows at 2370.54 (1789574400000), 2384.29 (1789560000000), 2436.87 (1789689600000), 2469.24 (1789704000000), and the post-climax pullback low 2633.31 holds well above the 2358.62-2850 leg's midpoint near 2604.", "The 2358.62 low was an undercut that failed: sellers could not hold below the prior 2411.04 range floor, and the market rallied 2358.62 to 2850 with wide-range bull bars and only one shallow pullback, which is an always-in-long structure on the larger window.", "Since 1789977600000 there is no bear spike and no lower low beneath 2633.31; the last 30 bars are overlapping small-range bars, so the bull structure has not been broken."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars, 1788681600000 to 1790395200000; window open 2495.86, window close 2689.76 (+7.8%).", "First 30 bars (to 1789113600000) are two-sided: highest high 2528.8 (1788724800000), lowest low 2411.04 (1789041600000), most closes between 2462.08 and 2520.07.", "1789128000000 is a wide bull bar O2457.12 H2680 L2444.19 C2555.52 (range 235.81); the 2680 high was not held and price was back at 2514.72 by 1789156800000.", "Window low 2358.62 printed at 1789488000000, after a lower high at 2609.02 (1789416000000).", "Rally leg 2358.62 (1789488000000) to 2850 (1789977600000) contains wide-range bars at 1789732800000 (O2507.15 H2585.5 C2578.6) and 1789977600000 (H2850 C2723.15); the only deep pullback was to 2568.16 (1789891200000).", "1789977600000 has a 191.94-point range with a 126.85-point upper tail; its close 2723.15 is near 34% of that bar's range.", "Post-climax 30 bars (1789992000000 to 1790395200000) stay inside 2633.31 to 2804.59, with highs stepping down 2804.59, 2786.81 (1790136000000), 2740.42 (1790323200000).", "Final four bars (1790352000000 to 1790395200000) have ranges of 17.82, 18.16, 14.43 and 7.68 points and all close between 2686.84 and 2692.59 inside 2676.22 to 2696.09."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "First-half two-sided range; repeated tests of the 2500-2528.8 area and the 2441-2463 area, later undercut to 2411.04.", "end_time_ms": 1789113600000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788681600000, "upper_boundary": "2528.8"}, {"description": "Wide bull spike bar that poked above the 2528.8 range top to 2680 and closed 2555.52, but follow-through failed and price returned into the 2469-2514 area.", "end_time_ms": 1789142399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2444.19", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Bear leg from the 2609.02 lower high to the 2358.62 low, an undercut of the first-half range floor.", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789416000000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Bull leg rising from 2358.62 with wide-range bars and one shallow pullback to 2568.16; a rising, increasingly overlapping sequence rather than a clean one-way spike.", "end_time_ms": 1789977599999, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789502400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Buy-climax bar: 191.94-point range, high 2850 with a 126.85-point upper tail, close 2723.15 in the lower third of the bar.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Post-climax consolidation of about 30 bars between 2633.31 and 2804.59, with a stepping-down high sequence and all closes between 2647.90 and 2775.61.", "end_time_ms": 1790409599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Final four bars overlap heavily with the smallest ranges of the window and closes clustered inside 2676.22 to 2696.09; a tight, directionless cluster within the larger range.", "end_time_ms": 1790409599999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2676.22", "start_time_ms": 1790352000000, "upper_boundary": "2696.09"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2850, or above 2804.59 with a strong bar and follow-through, would signal trend resumption and a new leg up, shifting the phase from range to breakout-spike.", "A close below 2633.31 on a wide bear bar with follow-through would break the range floor and make the read a bull trend that has ended, with 2604 (the 2358.6